                    "authorAssociation": "MEMBER",
                    "body": "Not quite. It requires setting custom `config.content.active`, then `MiniStatusline.active` will use it automatically. [Here](https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1830#discussioncomment-13295627) is a more detailed answer, which uses custom function for file name (instead of directly using `MiniStatusline.section_filename()`).",
                    "bodyHTML": "<p dir=\"auto\">Not quite. It requires setting custom <code class=\"notranslate\">config.content.active</code>, then <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniStatusline.active</code> will use it automatically. <a href=\"https://github.com/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1830#discussioncomment-13295627\" data-hovercard-type=\"discussion\" data-hovercard-url=\"/nvim-mini/mini.nvim/discussions/1830/hovercard?comment_id=13295627\">Here</a> is a more detailed answer, which uses custom function for file name (instead of directly using <code class=\"notranslate\">MiniStatusline.section_filename()</code>).</p>",
                    "bodyText": "Not quite. It requires setting custom config.content.active, then MiniStatusline.active will use it automatically. Here is a more detailed answer, which uses custom function for file name (instead of directly using MiniStatusline.section_filename()).",
